    rdfs:label "Adherence Collapse: ADHERENT+ → RATIONING → NON_ADHERENT → ADHERENCE_CRISIS" ;
    rdfs:comment "Tracks cost-driven medication adherence collapse. Patients who cannot afford medications first ration (splitting doses, skipping days), then stop refilling entirely. This sequence requires a confirmed ADHERENT baseline before the crisis escalation can arm — preventing false flags on patients who were never on medications." ;
